{
  "an4.14:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.14 ",
  "an4.14:0.2": "2. Caravagga ",
  "an4.14:0.3": "Saṁvarasutta ",
  "an4.14:1.1": "“Cattārimāni, bhikkhave, padhānāni. ",
  "an4.14:1.2": "Katamāni cattāri? ",
  "an4.14:1.3": "Saṁvarappadhānaṁ, pahānappadhānaṁ, bhāvanāppadhānaṁ, anurakkhaṇāppadhānaṁ. ",
  "an4.14:1.4": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, saṁvarappadhānaṁ? ",
  "an4.14:1.5": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu cakkhunā rūpaṁ disvā na nimittaggāhī hoti nānubyañjanaggāhī. ",
  "an4.14:1.6": "Yatvādhikaraṇamenaṁ cakkhundriyaṁ asaṁvutaṁ viharantaṁ abhijjhādomanassā pāpakā akusalā dhammā anvāssaveyyuṁ, tassa saṁvarāya paṭipajjati, rakkhati cakkhundriyaṁ, cakkhundriye saṁvaraṁ āpajjati. ",
  "an4.14:1.7": "Sotena saddaṁ sutvā … ",
  "an4.14:1.8": "ghānena gandhaṁ ghāyitvā … ",
  "an4.14:1.9": "jivhāya rasaṁ sāyitvā … ",
  "an4.14:1.10": "kāyena phoṭṭhabbaṁ phusitvā … ",
  "an4.14:1.11": "manasā dhammaṁ viññāya na nimittaggāhī hoti nānubyañjanaggāhī, ",
  "an4.14:1.12": "yatvādhikaraṇamenaṁ manindriyaṁ asaṁvutaṁ viharantaṁ abhijjhādomanassā pāpakā akusalā dhammā anvāssaveyyuṁ, tassa saṁvarāya paṭipajjati, rakkhati manindriyaṁ, manindriye saṁvaraṁ āpajjati. ",
  "an4.14:1.13": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, saṁvarappadhānaṁ. ",
  "an4.14:2.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, pahānappadhānaṁ? ",
  "an4.14:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu uppannaṁ kāmavitakkaṁ nādhivāseti p